				</p>
			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td width="133" valign="top" style="border:1.0000pt solid windowtext;background:#F1F1F1;">
				<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-left:10.5000pt;">
					<span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10.5000pt;"><span>数据、代码和其他材料的可用性</span></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10.5000pt;"></span>
				</p>
			</td>
			<td width="47" valign="top" style="border:1.0000pt solid windowtext;background:#F1F1F1;">
				<p class="MsoNormal">
					<span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10.5000pt;">27</span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10.5000pt;"></span>
				</p>
			</td>
			<td width="779" valign="top" style="border:1.0000pt solid windowtext;background:#F1F1F1;">
				<p class="MsoNormal">
					<span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10.5000pt;"><span>报告以下哪些内容可公开获取</span></span><span style="font-family:等线;font-size:10.5000pt;">及相应</span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10.5000pt;"><span>途径：</span></span><span style="font-family:等线;font-size:10.5000pt;">资料提取</span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10.5000pt;"><span>表模板；从纳入研究中提取的</span></span><span style="font-family:等线;font-size:10.5000pt;">资料</span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10.5000pt;"><span>；用于所有分析的</span></span><span style="font-family:等线;font-size:10.5000pt;">数据</span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10.5000pt;"><span>、分析编码和其他材料。</span></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10.5000pt;"></span>
				</p>
			</td>
